    "title": "prune_workspace deletes rlibs, rmeta files and proc-macros, not just test binaries",
    "description": "prune_workspace sweeps every entry in target/debug/deps older than keep_days, including compiled dependencies and proc-macro libraries. With keep_days=0 it is equivalent to wiping the dependency cache, which defeats cache retention. Consider an extension-aware (surgical) mode that only removes extension-less executables, mirroring outfeed_core::headroom::prune_test_binaries.",
